Z||000013||Predator||03-24-2001||08:53 AM||||Nice find man. You should try 400 at 06:30 in the morning. In Atlanta the speed limit is the road you are on. Highway 75 is 75, and 85 is 85. On 400 you just floor it to try and keep up. I had to install a Turbo in My Fiero just to keep from being run over  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||7
